<title>INDIA: Shaw Wallace 95/96 net 521,000 rupees.</title>
<headline>Shaw Wallace 95/96 net 521,000 rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian liquor maker Shaw Wallace and Co Ltd said on Wednesday that its net profit for 1995/96 (July-June) was 521,000 rupees.</p>
<p>It gave no comparative figure for 1994/95.  </p>
<p>Shaw Wallace said its gross income, including sales, for 1995/96 was 7.62 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The company said its profit before interest, depreciation and tax rose 17 percent to 514.0 million rupees.</p>
<p>It did not provide any comparative figures.</p>
<p>The company said that in 1996/97, it has maintained an impressive growth in operating profit in liquor as well as beer. &quot;The overall operating profit of all activities is likely to go up substantially over 1995/96,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Shaw Wallace said it is India's second largest liquor maker.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
